Z||000053||LZeitgeist||10-19-2001||05:27 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR>Originally posted by LZeitgeist:<BR>Well said.<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR> Then EdsB52 blathered:<BR>See what I mean by plenty of company on that bandwagon? LZeitgeist didn't read the posts carefully enough to remark, but he did anyway. I never asked if you met with Ray, I simply asked if you've spoken with him. People read what they want, not necessarily what is written.<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Blah, blah, blah... EdsB52, how in the f*ck do *you* know what I read and didn't read? I'm not getting drawn into the political side of the discussion, because I choose not to. However, when Formula88 made a statement that I agreed with (and quoted for clarity, in fact), I commented on it, since I've said as much before, and I felt it applied across the board, not just to Ray. Seems like you're the one failing reading comprehension since you can't even apply what I wrote to the text I had quoted in the same post. <P>-----------------------<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Formula88 writes: "I disagree with a lot you have to say, but your posts are more clearly worded. At least I have a better idea of what you mean, instead of having to guess and try to pull some meaning out of a chaotic post."<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR> And EdsB52 blathers again:<BR>And this is where you drive down the 'ad hominem' road. But don't worry; you're with many of the forum members. Now I've attacked many members here, but I ultimately attack the content of their posts, or lack there of, as opposed to dismissing what they have to say based on my dislike of their character. <HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>And just where did Formula88 say *anything* about your character? He commented that he 'disagrees with a lot you have to say'. He hasn't said a word about liking or disliking you. <P>Damn, and you have the balls to comment on *me* supposedly 'remarking without reading'... ummmm... whatever...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Blah, blah, blah...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">||||reg||1
