s instead of just the Jews. Focused on anyone not like yourself. That's predjudice and bigotry, Ray. An ugly side to any society. Sorry to say it, you're hateful sounding and bitter. <P>[This message has been edited by maryjane (edited 10-20-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>NO I DO NOT THINK ALL PROBLEMS WOULD GO AWAY JUST SOME OF THEM.<BR>I DONOT THINK OR HOPE TO IN ANYWAY LIMIT THE RIGHTS OF RELIGION, JUST THE SAME I DONOT WANT THEM TO HAVE POWER OVER ME OR THE LAWS I MUST FOLLOW. FREEDOM FROM RELIGION IN LAWS AND GOVERMENTS IS ALL THAT I WANT.<BR>LAWS NEED TO BE EQUAL IN TREATMENT TO ALL NOT THE WAY RUSH AND THE "" HEADS WANT BUSH TO CHANGE THE LAWS.<BR>EXAMPLE RIGHT NOW IN MIAMI A CHRISTIAN GROUP WANTS TO CHANGE LAWS ABOUT HUMAN RIGHTS AND ARE TRYING TO RECALL A GAY RIGHTS LAW.<BR>SAME PEOPLE WANT TO END WOMENS RIGHTS TOO CHOISE ON THEIR OWN BODIES FUNCTIONS. BY BOMBS IF OTHER MEANS FAIL<BR>BAN BOOKS AND MOVIES I CAN READ OR SEE.<BR>END FREEDOM ON THE INTERNET.<BR>I STILL IN 2OO1 CANNOT BUY A DRINK ON SUNDAY BEFORE 1:00 O'CLOCK AFTER CHURCH BY LAW<BR>OPEN A BAR WITH IN 1500 FT OF A CHURCH AT ANYTIME.<BR>I HAVE NEVER SAID THAT I HATE FOLLOWERS OF ANY RELIGION OR WANT ANY ACTION AGAINTS THEM  JUST THE RIGHT TO LAFF AT THEM WITHOUT FEAR THAT THEY CAN BURN ME AT THE STAKE AS THEY HAVE A LONG BLOODY HISTORY OF DOING TO ALL THEY CALL HERITIC.<BR>FAIRY TALES MAKE FOR BAD LAWS.TALIBAN OR CHRISTIAN OR ANYOTHERS.<P><P>------------------<BR>Question wonder and be wierd||||reg||1
Z||000074||maryjane||10-20-2001||02:50 PM||||Ray, we're not so far apart on civil rights beliefs. I've already stated my dislike of blue laws. I think they hinder commerce and the economy. I grew up in the 50's & 60's and remember the lack of equal rights vividly. It was a shameful period. I believe a person has the right to free speech, read and say what he believes and not be persecuted for it. It's how we learn from each other, we don't have to agree, but should respect each other's right to believe or reject a belief. Yes, I think you have the right to freedom from religion, strongly enough to say so publicly. Discrimination of any kind is detrimental to a society. I am in the right wing, mostly on foriegn policy and corporate economics. Haven't listened to Rush since the early 90's. Too much un-substantiated rhetoric. When I see this and any other administration forgive foreign debts owed us, yet there are homeless and destitute people here WITHOUT ADEQUATE HEALTH CARE, I get pretty po'd. I had a personal experience with some anti-abortion demonstrators outside a clinic many years ago. Nothing peaceful about it. I won't go into it here. It's taken me a long time to come to grips with the gay right's thing, but I've accepted it as being<BR>fair, and the right thing to do. This country has gotten better, in my lifetime, still a long way to go. Tolerance and acceptance is the key. Dis-agree, but accept and try to understand each other. Did some research on the Rawandan civil war. You might want to re-visit that. Between two tribes,(Hutu's & Tutsi) been going on actually the mid-late 50's. Both have similar religious beliefs, just different race or ethnic background. Each side guilty of genocide, when they were in power. When one is in power, they will drive the other tribe to adjoining countries; that is how it has spread to Congolese Republic , Uganda and Keyna. Pretty much all started when one side started using the weaker tribe as a labor force, the labor force then became too populous to deal with, so the in power tribe (Hutu's)figured it had to get rid of them. Could have avoided the genoicid if the UN had stepped in forcibly instead of sending in just a few Belgian and French soldiers in '94. It escalated again when th Hutu President was assiinated  in a plane shoot down, coming back from a peace conference.I had a good reply to your challenge typed up about 2:30am, with links included. Lost the whole thing when I ran spell check. Don't know where it went. Well it's been interesting Ray, I apologize for the harsh replys earlier, I just couldn't understand what you were asking. The bars are open, the game's on, Have a good day. I'm gonna take a nap.<BR>Don<p>[This message has been edited by maryjane (edited 10-20-2001).]||||reg||1
